{"seq":3,"slug":"bundle-margin-clearance-goal","title":"Bundle 毛利与清库存、搭售目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-inventory-price/bundle-margin-clearance-goal","wordCount":2119,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"bundle-毛利与清库存-搭售目标\">Bundle 毛利与清库存、搭售目标</h1><p>上一章解决了「钱怎么分回组件」，这一章问的是「为什么要分得这么便宜」。同一个组合可以服务两个几乎对立的目标：抬高毛利（用组合提升客单与利润）、消化库存（用组合把滞销件搭出去）。两者在定价上的分歧可以借经济学对捆绑的既有分析看清：纯捆绑下买家只能在整包与不买之间选择，而混合捆绑允许整包与单品并存，后者对卖家的价值在于当组件估值负相关时能压缩不同买家支付意愿的差异，从而比分别定价提取更多剩余（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Product_bundling\">Product bundling</a>）。这解释了为什么组合能同时让买家觉得便宜、让商家拿到更高的总收益——但它也意味着<strong>折扣深度必须被显式管理</strong>，否则剩余留在了买家那边。本篇讲清库存目标下折扣的底线、以及为什么不能简单地把折扣堆到滞销件上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>组合毛利不能只看「组合售价减组合成本」，必须区分<strong>增量贡献毛利</strong>与<strong>名义毛利</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CM</mtext><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CM}_{bundle} = P - \\sum_i q_i \\cdot \\text{cost}_i - \\sum_i q_i \\cdot h_i \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为组合实付，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为组件单位成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单位时间的持有成本率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为组件在被组合售出前预计的额外在库时间。后一项是清库存场景的关键：<strong>组合把滞销件的在库时间压缩，其节省的持有成本应当计入组合的贡献</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>名义毛利</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P - \\sum q_i \\text{cost}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对外报表、盘子口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量贡献毛利</td>\n<td>名义毛利 + 滞销件持有成本节省 + 未来降价损失规避</td>\n<td>清库存决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机会毛利</td>\n<td>名义毛利 − 被蚕食的组件单卖利润</td>\n<td>搭售效果评估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>蚕食（cannibalization）在搭售评估里不可省：如果买家本来就会分别买这两件，组合只是让出了折扣，机会毛利为负。蚕食的度量方法见 <a href=\"../bundle-merchandising/bundle-attach-rate-metric\">Bundle 附加率与组合效果度量</a>，本篇只把它作为约束条件使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"清库存的定价底线\">清库存的定价底线</h2><p>清库存组合的定价底线不是「不低于成本」，而是「不低于继续持有的期望净收益」。对于一件滞销件，继续持有意味着承担持有成本并等待降价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{floor} = \\text{cost}_i - h_i \\cdot T_{hold} - \\Delta_{markdown}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">oor</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即，只要组合中该组件的隐含净价不低于「成本减去继续持有可能的降价损失与持有成本」，搭出去就是划算的。这条式子解释了为什么清库存组合的折扣经常看起来「低于成本」——因为继续持有本身也是亏的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[滞销组件候选] --&gt; B[计算继续持有净收益]&#10;  B --&gt; C{组合隐含净价 &gt;= 持有净收益}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[可入组合, 允许大折扣]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[拒绝入组合, 改走独立降价]&#10;  D --&gt; F{是否被蚕食}&#10;  F --&gt;|热销件被搭售| G[按机会毛利否决]&#10;  F --&gt;|无蚕食| H[接受, 记为清库存型组合]&#10;  G --&gt; I[改选非热销件做搭配]\">graph TD\n  A[滞销组件候选] --&gt; B[计算继续持有净收益]\n  B --&gt; C{组合隐含净价 &gt;= 持有净收益}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[可入组合, 允许大折扣]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[拒绝入组合, 改走独立降价]\n  D --&gt; F{是否被蚕食}\n  F --&gt;|热销件被搭售| G[按机会毛利否决]\n  F --&gt;|无蚕食| H[接受, 记为清库存型组合]\n  G --&gt; I[改选非热销件做搭配]</pre><h3 id=\"持有成本的量级\">持有成本的量级</h3><p>持有成本通常按库存价值的年化百分比估算，包含资金占用、仓储、跌价与废弃风险。工程上不必追求精确，但必须<strong>显式参数化</strong>，因为一旦缺失，运营会退化为「凭感觉打几折」。给定年化持有成本率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，单位时间的持有成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>365</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h \\cdot \\text{cost}_i / 365</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/365</span></span></span></span></span>，把这个数字放进组合定价的最优化目标里，清库存组合的折扣深度就自动有了依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反向约束-不要把好货搭出去\">反向约束：不要把好货搭出去</h2><p>清库存目标最容易被滥用的地方，是把热销件放进组合当诱饵。这会让组合的隐含净价结构极度倾斜：好货被压价、滞销件拿到虚高的分摊金额。后果有两个——机会毛利被蚕食掉，以及<strong>退款基数错配</strong>带来的反薅。</p>\n<p>退款基数的错配是本 hub 反复出现的主题。如果组合把折扣全部堆在滞销件上（滞销件分摊金额接近 0，好货分摊金额接近原价），买家退好货时按分摊基数能拿回几乎全额，而实际组合让利早已被滞销件吃掉。这就是 <a href=\"bundle-price-allocation-component\">Bundle 价格/折扣在组件上的分摊</a> 中「相对独立售价」口径的价值：它天然把折扣按组件价值比例分配，不会让某个组件的退款基数为 0。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分摊口径与清库存目标的张力\">分摊口径与清库存目标的张力</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>希望的分摊</th>\n<th>冲突</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>清库存</td>\n<td>折扣堆到滞销件</td>\n<td>滞销件退款基数趋 0，退货无法退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反薅与合规</td>\n<td>按独立售价比例</td>\n<td>折扣被平均，滞销件获得的价格信号弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收入确认</td>\n<td>按独立售价比例</td>\n<td>同反薅口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>解决张力不靠改分摊口径（口径一变，退款与收入确认都要跟着变），而是靠<strong>选品</strong>：把严重滞销的组件与同样滞销的组件组合，或与低退货率的组件组合。折扣深度通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{floor}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">oor</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制，分摊口径保持稳定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"搭配推荐的目标函数\">搭配推荐的目标函数</h2><p>搭配推荐（attach）的目标不是「提高被推荐组合的点击」，而是提高<strong>增量</strong>附加率。机器学习侧的模型目标与业务目标之间存在系统性偏差，近年有工作专门处理这个问题：用知识蒸馏剥离流行度偏差，让搭配推荐能真正服务于长尾与滞销商品而非进一步堆高热销件（见 arXiv:2411.19107，<em>Headache to Overstock? Promoting Long-tail Items through Debiased Product Bundling</em>，<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.19107）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.19107）。</a></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def attach_objective(candidates, baseline_orders):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;以增量附加率为目标，惩罚蚕食&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    scored = []&#10;    for c in candidates:&#10;        # 只保留能带来增量成交的搭配，排除本来就会一起买的组合&#10;        lift = c.attach_rate - baseline_orders.co_purchase_rate(c.pair)&#10;        if lift &lt;= 0:&#10;            continue&#10;        # 用增量的贡献毛利排序，而非组合 GMV&#10;        scored.append((c, lift * c.incremental_cm))&#10;    return sorted(scored, key=lambda x: -x[1])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> attach_objective</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(candidates, baseline_orders):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"以增量附加率为目标，惩罚蚕食\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 只保留能带来增量成交的搭配，排除本来就会一起买的组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        lift </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.attach_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_orders.co_purchase_rate(c.pair)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lift </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 用增量的贡献毛利排序，而非组合 GMV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        scored.append((c, lift </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.incremental_cm))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scored, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个目标函数里最关键的一行是 <code>lift</code> 的计算：用<strong>基线共同购买率</strong>作为对照，只有超出基线的部分才算增量。缺少这一步的推荐系统会不断把「本来就一起买」的组合推给买家，指标好看但没有任何增量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合策略的参数化治理\">组合策略的参数化治理</h2><p>组合的三个目标（毛利、清库存、搭售）在系统里应当表现为同一组可配置参数，而非三套代码路径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>margin_floor</td>\n<td>组合增量贡献毛利下限</td>\n<td>正值，按品类设定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>clearance_floor</td>\n<td>允许低于成本的清库存底线</td>\n<td>由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{floor}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">oor</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cannibalization_cap</td>\n<td>允许蚕食的机会毛利上限</td>\n<td>按热销件等级分档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>allocation_basis</td>\n<td>分摊基准口径</td>\n<td>固定为独立售价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这四个参数放进组合定义而非硬编码，运营才能在旺季与清库存季之间切换策略，而不需要发版。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标冲突的裁决顺序\">目标冲突的裁决顺序</h2><p>三个目标同时作用在一个组合上时，需要明确的裁决顺序，否则会出现「既想清库存又想守毛利」的不可满足约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>反薅是硬约束</strong>：分摊基数不得使任一组件的退款基数为 0 或接近 0，违反即否决该组合。</li>\n<li><strong>合规是硬约束</strong>：收入确认口径以独立售价为基准，不可为目标让路。</li>\n<li><strong>蚕食上限是软约束</strong>：超出 <code>cannibalization_cap</code> 时降级为「不推荐但可买」。</li>\n<li><strong>毛利与清库存是优化目标</strong>：在硬约束内最大化增量贡献毛利，清库存目标通过 <code>clearance_floor</code> 放宽下限。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个顺序的解释是：前两条一旦违反就无法通过调参修复（退款争议与审计问题是外生的），后两条可以在运行时通过参数调节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>违反后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>反薅</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>退款争议、资损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规（收入确认）</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>审计问题、报表重述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蚕食上限</td>\n<td>软</td>\n<td>机会毛利下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毛利</td>\n<td>优化</td>\n<td>利润未达预期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清库存</td>\n<td>优化</td>\n<td>呆滞持续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>组合毛利应区分名义、增量贡献与机会毛利三个口径，清库存决策用的是增量贡献。</li>\n<li>清库存定价底线是「继续持有的期望净收益」，而不是成本线，所以要显式参数化持有成本。</li>\n<li>不要用热销件做清库存组合的诱饵：既蚕食机会毛利，又造成退款基数错配。</li>\n<li>分摊口径与清库存目标的张力靠选品解决，不要改分摊口径。</li>\n<li>搭配推荐的目标应是超出基线共同购买率的增量附加率，并对蚕食设上限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>组合的定价与目标确定后，进入实物环节：怎么拣货、怎么组装，见 <a href=\"../bundle-fulfillment/kit-assembly-fulfill-option\">随单组装 vs 预组装的履约选择</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Bundle 毛利与清库存、搭售目标","id":"bundle-毛利与清库存-搭售目标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"清库存的定价底线","id":"清库存的定价底线"},{"level":3,"text":"持有成本的量级","id":"持有成本的量级"},{"level":2,"text":"反向约束：不要把好货搭出去","id":"反向约束-不要把好货搭出去"},{"level":3,"text":"分摊口径与清库存目标的张力","id":"分摊口径与清库存目标的张力"},{"level":2,"text":"搭配推荐的目标函数","id":"搭配推荐的目标函数"},{"level":2,"text":"组合策略的参数化治理","id":"组合策略的参数化治理"},{"level":2,"text":"目标冲突的裁决顺序","id":"目标冲突的裁决顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Bundle 价格与折扣在组件上的分摊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-inventory-price/bundle-price-allocation-component"},"next":{"title":"随单组装与预组装：履约时机的选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-fulfillment/kit-assembly-fulfill-option"}}